root	/home/resources/packages/prolog/cmu_prolog
origin	the CMU Artificial Intelligence Repository, lang/prolog/code (Prime Time Freeware for AI, Issue 1-1, 1994): Prolog code for benchmarking, research, education and fun, posted to comp.lang.prolog
version	the repository's files as fetched 2026-11-14 (no version control upstream)
